ng the queue  write it down justify everything number  five lastly  turn a no into a yes when you're told no  which you need to expect because you're  going to get rejected  don't take it personally but also don't  accept that that is a forever no  when someone tells me no oh i don't hear  no i hear  not for now you've got to follow up  call them back a week later hey i know i  offered you 150 000 pounds on your  property  it's now been a week how's it going  follow follow up  when the estate agent says oh no way  would my client accept 150 000 pounds  you need to say  fair enough completely understand have  you got any other  property owners that are a little bit  more motivated  so when you get a no think of how you  can turn it into another opportunity or  into a yes  folks there are the five steps don't  keep watching me on youtube  go view some houses there's incredible  deals out there  go get some deals sell some deals  package some deals  buy some deals that's what makes me  excited most of my content on my youtube  channel  is not me talking it's me pulling people  like you  onto youtube and interviewing your  success as a result of listening to me  on youtube and going on my training  if you want me to mentor you as well if  you want to be mentored in property  i've got a whole team of mentors check  the description  in the link below and you can see how  you can get further training  but don't even do that just go and view  some houses and get some deals  thanks so much for watching peace out  see you next time

